@ctx
>>stack
> Node 22, TypeScript 5.4 strict, Express 5
> PostgreSQL 16 via pg (no ORM); migrations via node-pg-migrate
> Zod for all request validation; Stripe SDK v16
>>workflow
> conventional commits: feat|fix|chore|docs
> all routes need Zod schema + integration test before DONE
> never mark P0 task DONE without staging verification
? task:done AND task starts with stripe => verify in Railway staging logs
? task:blocked => add blocker to @state.blockers and set @state.err
? task:added => ensure priority assigned (not ~) unless milestone
- coverage threshold: 80% lines; track in >>mem coverage
>>secrets
- reference by *ENV_VAR_NAME only; never inline
- vars: *STRIPE_WH_SECRET *DATABASE_URL *JWT_SECRET

@hook
task:done    => > append ACT:task-id marked DONE to @log
task:blocked => > set @state.status BLOCK if any P0 task is blocked
session:end  => > append NOTE:session summary to @log; update @state.next_act
err:raised   => > set @state.err to error description

